IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q06-COUNT-DEPOSITS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-N               PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-IDX             PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-THRESHOLD       PIC 9(9) VALUE 0.
01 WS-COUNT           PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 WS-DISP-CNT        PIC Z(3)9.
01 WS-DEP-TABLE.
   05 WS-DEP-AMT      PIC 9(9) OCCURS 1000 TIMES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT WS-N
PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-N
    ACCEPT WS-DEP-AMT(WS-IDX)
END-PERFORM
ACCEPT WS-THRESHOLD
PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > WS-N
    IF WS-DEP-AMT(WS-IDX) > WS-THRESHOLD
        ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
    END-IF
END-PERFORM
MOVE WS-COUNT TO WS-DISP-CNT
DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DISP-CNT)
STOP RUN.
